  "translation": "This morning, I got up at seven. My book is on the bed, my schoolbag is under the bed, and there is also a cat outside the room. I first had breakfast with my mom and dad. My family has three people. I didn't know what to eat, so my mom gave me bread. For breakfast, I drank a cup of milk, ate an egg and a piece of bread. This egg is very tasty, and I can eat one more. In the morning, I immediately went to school from home. I didn't know how to get to school. The school is to the left of home, and a supermarket is to the right of home. I sit in a classroom, with classmates in front and behind. They all study very happily. In the afternoon, I went home together with my friend. We didn't take a car, we often walk home. After arriving home, I immediately wrote two pages of homework. While I was doing homework, mom was cooking. For dinner, we ate rice and tomato egg soup. Mom can make this soup, the food was too delicious. In the evening, I watched TV for half an hour, didn't watch much, then I read that book. Today is really happy!"
